 or more email addresses from your approved domains. --- [m10n]bizAccess.sso.allowlist.excluded.helper":"Add one or more email addresses from your approved domains.","Add some text content to your note --- BoardNoteEditor.SubtitlePlaceholder":"Add some text content to your note","Advertisers who used Catalog Enhance to improve product titles and descriptions with generative AI saw a 2.7% increase in CTR*. Your enhancements are ready to go, all you need to do is review and publish the changes! --- catalogs.Enhancements.promoBanner.body":"Advertisers who used Catalogue Enhance to improve product titles and descriptions with generative AI saw a 2.7% increase in CTR*. Your enhancements are ready to go. All you need to do is review and publish the changes!","After you complete setup, it may take up to 24 hours for SSO to be enabled for every member. --- [m10n]bizAccess.sso.allowlist.enablementDelay":"After you complete set-up, it may take up to 24 hours for SSO to be enabled for every member.","All members --- [m10n]bizAccess.sso.allowlist.allMembers.title":"All members","All members on your approved domains will be required to log in with {{idpName}} --- [m10n]bizAccess.sso.allowlist.allMembers.description":"All members on your approved domains will be required to log in with {{idpName}}","Are you sure you want to delete this note? This action cannot be undone. --- BoardNoteEditor.DeleteConfirmMessage":"Are you sure you want to delete this note? This action cannot be undone.","Business accounts that aren't tied to any one employee's email address and password are more secure and easier to manage. Create a new business account here or on the Business Hierarchy page to get started. --- [m10n]bizAccess.businessHierarchy.dashboard.brand_accounts_banner.message":"Business accounts that aren't tied to any one employee's email address and password are more secure and easier to manage. Create a new business account here or on the Business Hierarchy page to get started.","Cancel --- BoardNoteEditor.DeleteCancel":"Cancel","Choose members who won’t be required to log in with {{idpName}} --- [m10n]bizAccess.sso.allowlist.except.description":"Choose members who won’t be required to log in with {{idpName}}","Close --- [m10n]bizAccess.sidePanel.createBusiness.button.popover.actionText":"Close","Confirm delete note --- BoardNoteEditor.DeleteConfirmAccessibilityLabel":"Confirm delete note","Continuing will remove your {{count}} excluded member. They’ll be required to log in with {{idpName}}. --- [m10n]bizAccess.sso.allowlist.clearWarning _one":"Continuing will remove your {{count}} excluded member. They’ll be required to log in with {{idpName}}.","Continuing will remove your {{count}} excluded member. They’ll be required to log in with {{idpName}}. --- [m10n]bizAccess.sso.allowlist.clearWarning _other":"Continuing will remove your {{count}} excluded members. They’ll be required to log in with {{idpName}}.","Create Business account --- [m10n]bizAccess.businessHierarchy.dashboard.brand_accounts_banner.ctaButton.label":"Create business account","Creating a business account no longer requires an email and password --- [m10n]bizAccess.sidePanel.createBusiness.button.popover.message":"Creating a business account no longer requires an email address and password","Delete --- BoardNoteEditor.DeleteOption":"Delete","Delete note? --- BoardNoteEditor.DeleteConfirmHeading":"Delete note?","Description of the new create business account button on the hierarchy page --- [m10n]bizAccess.sidePanel.createBusiness.button.popover.accessibilityLabel":"Description of the new create business account button on the hierarchy page","Dismiss button for new business hierarchy brand accounts page banner --- [m10n]bizAccess.businessHierarchy.dashboard.brand_accounts_banner.dismissButton.label":"Dismiss button for new business hierarchy brand accounts page banner","Done --- BoardNoteEditor.DoneButton":"Done","Everyone except specific members --- [m10n]bizAccess.sso.allowlist.exc